{"id":"99200541bb81e8f3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/002_Peirce–Mitchell_关系逻辑.md","title":"002 Peirce–Mitchell 关系逻辑","display":"002_Peirce–Mitchell_关系逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始数据\">1. 原始数据</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RelVar}=\\{r_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RelVar}=\\{r_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Peirce--Mitchell 关系逻辑的原始关系项构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rv},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{id},\n\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{comp},\n\\operatorname{conv},\\operatorname{prod}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rv},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{id},\n\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{comp},\n\\operatorname{conv},\\operatorname{prod}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}(a,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{prod}(a,b)\\)</span> 是相对乘积，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conv}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{conv}(a)\\)</span> 是关系逆。显示记号如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0,1,I,\\quad a+b,\\quad a\\cdot b,\\quad \\overline a,\\quad a^\\smile,\\quad a;b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0,1,I,\\quad a+b,\\quad a\\cdot b,\\quad \\overline a,\\quad a^\\smile,\\quad a;b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些显示记号严格定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{zero}\\mapsto 0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}\\mapsto 1,\\quad\n\\operatorname{id}\\mapsto I,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{zero}\\mapsto 0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}\\mapsto 1,\\quad\n\\operatorname{id}\\mapsto I,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join}(a,b)\\mapsto a+b,\\quad\n\\operatorname{meet}(a,b)\\mapsto a\\cdot b,\\quad\n\\operatorname{comp}(a)\\mapsto\\overline a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{join}(a,b)\\mapsto a+b,\\quad\n\\operatorname{meet}(a,b)\\mapsto a\\cdot b,\\quad\n\\operatorname{comp}(a)\\mapsto\\overline a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conv}(a)\\mapsto a^\\smile,\\quad\n\\operatorname{prod}(a,b)\\mapsto a;b,\\quad\n\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)\\mapsto a=b.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conv}(a)\\mapsto a^\\smile,\\quad\n\\operatorname{prod}(a,b)\\mapsto a;b,\\quad\n\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)\\mapsto a=b.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等式是唯一原始断言构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}(a,b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eq}(a,b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>包含记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\le b\">\\(a\\le b\\)</span> 是非原始缩写，定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le b\\quad:\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad \\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{join}(a,b),b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le b\\quad:\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad \\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{join}(a,b),b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异为：本系统的对象项属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>，主断言属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\">\\(\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\)</span>，并以相对乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}\">\\(\\operatorname{prod}\\)</span>、逆运算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conv}\">\\(\\operatorname{conv}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\">\\(\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\\)</span> 的双向规则为特征。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-关系项\">2. 关系项</h1>\n<p>定义关系项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathsf{RelVar}\">\\(r\\in\\mathsf{RelVar}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rv}(r)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\operatorname{rv}(r)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join}(a,b)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\operatorname{join}(a,b)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{meet}(a,b)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\operatorname{meet}(a,b)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comp}(a)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\operatorname{comp}(a)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conv}(a)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\operatorname{conv}(a)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}(a,b)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(\\operatorname{prod}(a,b)\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-断言、变量与替换\">3. 断言、变量与替换</h1>\n<p>断言集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}=\\{\\operatorname{eq}(a,b):a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}=\\{\\operatorname{eq}(a,b):a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由关系变元函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RV}:\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RV}:\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{rv}(r))=\\{r\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{rv}(r))=\\{r\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{id})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{zero})=\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{id})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{join}(a,b))\n=\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{meet}(a,b))\n=\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{prod}(a,b))\n=\\operatorname{RV}(a)\\cup\\operatorname{RV}(b),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{join}(a,b))\n=\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{meet}(a,b))\n=\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{prod}(a,b))\n=\\operatorname{RV}(a)\\cup\\operatorname{RV}(b),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{comp}(a))\n=\n\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{conv}(a))\n=\n\\operatorname{RV}(a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{comp}(a))\n=\n\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{conv}(a))\n=\n\\operatorname{RV}(a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对断言定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{eq}(a,b))=\\operatorname{RV}(a)\\cup\\operatorname{RV}(b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RV}(\\operatorname{eq}(a,b))=\\operatorname{RV}(a)\\cup\\operatorname{RV}(b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系项替换为函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}:\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\times\\mathsf{RelVar}\\times\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}:\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\times\\mathsf{RelVar}\\times\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a[r:=c]\">\\(a[r:=c]\\)</span>。其子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rv}(s)[r:=c]=\n\\begin{cases}\nc,&amp;s=r,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rv}(s),&amp;s\\ne r,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rv}(s)[r:=c]=\n\\begin{cases}\nc,&amp;s=r,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rv}(s),&amp;s\\ne r,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{zero}[r:=c]=\\operatorname{zero},\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[r:=c]=\\operatorname{one},\\quad\n\\operatorname{id}[r:=c]=\\operatorname{id},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{zero}[r:=c]=\\operatorname{zero},\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[r:=c]=\\operatorname{one},\\quad\n\\operatorname{id}[r:=c]=\\operatorname{id},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join}(a,b)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{join}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{join}(a,b)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{join}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{meet}(a,b)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{meet}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{meet}(a,b)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{meet}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comp}(a)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{comp}(a[r:=c]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{comp}(a)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{comp}(a[r:=c]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conv}(a)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{conv}(a[r:=c]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conv}(a)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{conv}(a[r:=c]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}(a,b)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{prod}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod}(a,b)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{prod}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>断言替换定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{eq}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)[r:=c]=\\operatorname{eq}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式化地，关系项出现函数和断言出现函数分别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{T}:\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{E}:\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{T}:\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{E}:\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{T}(a)=\\operatorname{RV}(a),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{E}(\\operatorname{eq}(a,b))=\\operatorname{RV}(a)\\cup\\operatorname{RV}(b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{T}(a)=\\operatorname{RV}(a),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{E}(\\operatorname{eq}(a,b))=\\operatorname{RV}(a)\\cup\\operatorname{RV}(b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由出现函数同义接口：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{T}:\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{E}:\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{T}:\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{E}:\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{RelVar}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{T}(a)=\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{T}(a),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{E}(E)=\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{E}(E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{T}(a)=\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{T}(a),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{E}(E)=\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{E}(E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>断言替换函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}^{E}:\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\times\\mathsf{RelVar}\\times\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}^{E}:\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\times\\mathsf{RelVar}\\times\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\to\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}^{E}(\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),r,c)\n=\n\\operatorname{eq}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}^{E}(\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),r,c)\n=\n\\operatorname{eq}(a[r:=c],b[r:=c]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为关系项与断言的字面相等。</p>\n<p>形式化地，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{PM,T}\n=\n\\{(a,a):a\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{PM,T}\n=\n\\{(a,a):a\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{PM,E}\n=\n\\{(E,E):E\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{PM,E}\n=\n\\{(E,E):E\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有替换均为关系变元替换；没有绑定名、新名选择或捕获避免分支。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理断言集合\">4. 公理断言集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PM}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{R}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PM}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{R}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Boolean 部分为下列等式实例的集合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(a,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\n=\n\\{\na+(b+c)=(a+b)+c,\\ \na+b=b+a,\\ \na+0=a,\\ \na+\\overline a=1,\\ \na\\cdot b=\\overline{\\overline a+\\overline b},\\ \n\\overline{\\overline a}=a\n:\na,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\n=\n\\{\na+(b+c)=(a+b)+c,\\ \na+b=b+a,\\ \na+0=a,\\ \na+\\overline a=1,\\ \na\\cdot b=\\overline{\\overline a+\\overline b},\\ \n\\overline{\\overline a}=a\n:\na,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逆运算部分为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\n=\n\\{\n(a^\\smile)^\\smile=a,\\ \n(a+b)^\\smile=a^\\smile+b^\\smile,\\ \n(a;b)^\\smile=b^\\smile;a^\\smile,\\ \nI^\\smile=I\n:\na,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\n=\n\\{\n(a^\\smile)^\\smile=a,\\ \n(a+b)^\\smile=a^\\smile+b^\\smile,\\ \n(a;b)^\\smile=b^\\smile;a^\\smile,\\ \nI^\\smile=I\n:\na,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相对乘积部分为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{R}\n=\n\\{\n(a;b);c=a;(b;c),\\ \nI;a=a,\\ \na;I=a,\\ \n0;a=0,\\ \na;0=0,\\ \n(a+b);c=(a;c)+(b;c),\\ \na;(b+c)=(a;b)+(a;c)\n:\na,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{R}\n=\n\\{\n(a;b);c=a;(b;c),\\ \nI;a=a,\\ \na;I=a,\\ \n0;a=0,\\ \na;0=0,\\ \n(a+b);c=(a;c)+(b;c),\\ \na;(b+c)=(a;b)+(a;c)\n:\na,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Peirce--Mitchell 特有的包含-乘积互定义数据不是断言公理，而是断言对关系。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\n=\n\\{\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{join}(\\operatorname{prod}(a,b),c),c),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{join}(a,\\operatorname{prod}(c,\\operatorname{conv}(b))),\\operatorname{prod}(c,\\operatorname{conv}(b)))\n\\bigr)\n:\na,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\n=\n\\{\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{join}(\\operatorname{prod}(a,b),c),c),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{join}(a,\\operatorname{prod}(c,\\operatorname{conv}(b))),\\operatorname{prod}(c,\\operatorname{conv}(b)))\n\\bigr)\n:\na,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(E,F\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Def}_{D},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(E,F\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Def}_{D},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,F\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\">\\(E,F\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\)</span>。这给出相对乘积的包含互定义方向，并且是本系统区别于普通 Boolean 关系代数等式演算的形式 delta。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-规则关系\">5. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>等式自反规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Refl}\n=\n\\{((),\\operatorname{eq}(a,a)):a\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Refl}\n=\n\\{((),\\operatorname{eq}(a,a)):a\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对称规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sym}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)),\\operatorname{eq}(b,a)):a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sym}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)),\\operatorname{eq}(b,a)):a,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>传递规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),\\operatorname{eq}(b,c)),\\operatorname{eq}(a,c)):a,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),\\operatorname{eq}(b,c)),\\operatorname{eq}(a,c)):a,b,c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐构造子同余规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cong}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{meet}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{comp}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{conv}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{prod},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cong}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{meet}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{comp}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{conv}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{prod},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),\\operatorname{eq}(c,d)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{join}(a,c),\\operatorname{join}(b,d))):\na,b,c,d\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),\\operatorname{eq}(c,d)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{join}(a,c),\\operatorname{join}(b,d))):\na,b,c,d\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{meet}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),\\operatorname{eq}(c,d)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{meet}(a,c),\\operatorname{meet}(b,d))):\na,b,c,d\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{meet}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),\\operatorname{eq}(c,d)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{meet}(a,c),\\operatorname{meet}(b,d))):\na,b,c,d\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{comp}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{comp}(a),\\operatorname{comp}(b))):\na,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{comp}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{comp}(a),\\operatorname{comp}(b))):\na,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{conv}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{conv}(a),\\operatorname{conv}(b))):\na,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{conv}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{conv}(a),\\operatorname{conv}(b))):\na,b\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{prod}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),\\operatorname{eq}(c,d)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{prod}(a,c),\\operatorname{prod}(b,d))):\na,b,c,d\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{prod}\n=\n\\{((\\operatorname{eq}(a,b),\\operatorname{eq}(c,d)),\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\operatorname{prod}(a,c),\\operatorname{prod}(b,d))):\na,b,c,d\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系变元替换规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}\n=\n\\{((E),\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}^{E}(E,r,c)):\nE\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM},r\\in\\mathsf{RelVar},c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}\n=\n\\{((E),\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}^{E}(E,r,c)):\nE\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM},r\\in\\mathsf{RelVar},c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>双向定义规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{D}\n=\n\\{((E),F): (E,F)\\in\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((F),E): (E,F)\\in\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{D}\n=\n\\{((E),F): (E,F)\\in\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{((F),E): (E,F)\\in\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{PM}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Refl}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sym}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cong}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{D}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{PM}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Refl}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sym}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cong}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{D}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\)</span> 出发的 Peirce--Mitchell 证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\">\\(E_i\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\">\\(E_i\\)</span> 至少满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(E_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{R}\">\\(E_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{B}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{R}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{D}\">\\(((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{D}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\">\\(E_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{Refl}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Refl}\\)</span> 的结论；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sym}\">\\(((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sym}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j,E_k),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}\">\\(((E_j,E_k),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{comp}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{conv}\">\\(((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{comp}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{conv}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j,E_k),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{meet}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{prod}\">\\(((E_j,E_k),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{join}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{meet}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{prod}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathsf{RelVar}\">\\(r\\in\\mathsf{RelVar}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}\">\\(((E_j),E_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{PM}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{PM}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_i\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\">\\(E_i\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\)</span>，并且上列 1--9 中至少一项成立。</p>\n<p>定义证明对象集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{PM}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1}):m&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{PM}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{PM}(\\Gamma)\n=\n\\{\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1}):m&gt;0\\land\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{PM}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-推导关系\">7. 推导关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{PM}E\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{PM}E\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{PM}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=(E_0,\\ldots,E_{m-1})\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{PM}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{m-1}=E\">\\(E_{m-1}=E\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义等式理论闭包</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{PM}(\\Gamma)=\\{E\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{PM}E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cn}_{PM}(\\Gamma)=\\{E\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{PM}E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标区分条款\">8. 目标区分条款</h1>\n<p>定义 Peirce--Mitchell 构造子集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctor}_{PM}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{rv},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{id},\n\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{comp},\n\\operatorname{conv},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{eq}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ctor}_{PM}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{rv},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{id},\n\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{comp},\n\\operatorname{conv},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{eq}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{PM}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{prod}\\in\\mathsf{Ctor}_{PM}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{conv}\\in\\mathsf{Ctor}_{PM}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\times\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{PM}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\quad\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{PM}(\\Gamma)=\\{E\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{PM}E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{PM}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{prod}\\in\\mathsf{Ctor}_{PM}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{conv}\\in\\mathsf{Ctor}_{PM}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Def}_{D}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\times\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\n\\land\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{PM}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}\\quad\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{PM}(\\Gamma)=\\{E\\in\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM}:\\Gamma\\vdash_{PM}E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该条件把本系统限定为带相对乘积、逆运算和包含互定义规则的关系项等式演算。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PMRel}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{RelVar},\n\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM},\n\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM},\n\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{T},\n\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{E},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{T},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{E},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}^{E},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PM,T},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PM,E},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{PM},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Refl},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sym},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cong},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub},\n\\mathsf{Def}_{D},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{D},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{PM},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{PM},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{PM},\n\\vdash_{PM},\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{PM},\n\\mathsf{Ctor}_{PM},\n\\Delta_{PM}\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PMRel}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{RelVar},\n\\mathsf{RTm}_{PM},\n\\mathsf{Eqn}_{PM},\n\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{T},\n\\operatorname{RV}_{PM}^{E},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{T},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PM}^{E},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{PM}^{E},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PM,T},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PM,E},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{PM},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Refl},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sym},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Trans},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Cong},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Sub},\n\\mathsf{Def}_{D},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{D},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{PM},\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{PM},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{PM},\n\\vdash_{PM},\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{PM},\n\\mathsf{Ctor}_{PM},\n\\Delta_{PM}\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的最终元组只列出关系项、等式断言、相对乘积、逆运算、等式证明规则、推导关系、推导闭包和目标区分条件；不含关系结构、解释、满足关系或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始数据","text":"1. 原始数据","level":1},{"id":"2.-关系项","text":"2. 关系项","level":1},{"id":"3.-断言、变量与替换","text":"3. 断言、变量与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理断言集合","text":"4. 公理断言集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则关系","text":"5. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-推导关系","text":"7. 推导关系","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标区分条款","text":"8. 目标区分条款","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{RelVar}=\\{r_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rv},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{id},\n\\operatorname{join},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{comp},\n\\operatorname{conv},\\operatorname{prod}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{prod}(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{conv}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,I,\\quad a+b,\\quad a\\cdot b,\\quad \\overline a,\\quad a^\\smile,\\quad a;b.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{zero}\\mapsto 0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}\\mapsto 1,\\quad\n\\operatorname{id}\\mapsto I,","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname